# When designing orchestration or state machines, treat field (preference)

Standing user preference: When designing orchestration or state machines, treat field combinations that must always co-occur as atomic invariants — enforce them structurally and never allow partial or inconsistent state.

## Conventions
- When designing orchestration or state machines, treat field combinations that must always co-occur as atomic invariants — enforce them structurally and never allow partial or inconsistent state.

